# Canonical author identities for this repository.
# Git and GitHub use this file to fold commit identities together when
# computing history, `git shortlog`, blame and the contributor graph.
#
# Any commit that carries the noreply@anthropic.com address (e.g. an
# automated "Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>" identity from a tooling
# session) is mapped to the sole human author, so it never appears as a
# separate contributor.
fabkoe <fabian@solf.it> <noreply@anthropic.com>
